  text "Paused: its endpoint kept failing — {Why}" => null;
  /// Osysharp.Webhooks.WebhookPaused.Sentence · text on the page
  /// shown through Sentence()
  text "Paused: its endpoint kept failing." => "متوقف مؤقتًا: فشلت نقطة الاستقبال مرارًا.";

  // ── Osysharp.Webhooks · Osysharp.Webhooks.WebhookSettingsSections.Sections ──
