  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  /// beside: "Delivery log"
  description "Each gets the events it takes, signed with its own secret. One that keeps failing is paused, and says why." => "تحصل كل نقطة استقبال على الأحداث التي تستقبلها، موقّعة بسرّها الخاص. والتي تفشل مرارًا تُوقف مؤقتًا وتوضح السبب.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a description
  /// shown through SettingsPage.description
  description "Tell other systems when something happens here. Each event is sent to the endpoints that take it as a signed JSON document, and tried again while an endpoint is down." => "أخبر الأنظمة الأخرى عندما يحدث شيء هنا. يُرسل كل حدث إلى نقاط الاستقبال التي تستقبله كمستند JSON موقّع، ويُعاد إرساله ما دامت نقطة الاستقبال متعطلة.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  hint "An https:// address that answers 2xx when it has the document." => "عنوان https:// يرد بـ 2xx عندما يستلم المستند.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  hint "It keeps its secret." => "يحتفظ بسرّه.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~14 characters
  /// shown through Field.label
  label "Endpoint" => "نقطة الاستقبال";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~11 characters
  /// shown through Dropdown.label
  /// beside: "Cancel"
  label "Event" => "الحدث";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~18 characters
  /// shown through Field.label
  label "New endpoint" => "نقطة استقبال جديدة";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~33 characters
  /// placeholders: {value} = …
  /// shown through Switch.label
  label "Only what failed{value}" => "الفاشلة فقط{value}";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~16 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "Events", "Cancel"
  placeholder "Order sync" => "مزامنة الطلبات";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~45 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  placeholder "https://example.com/hooks/orders" => "https://example.com/hooks/orders";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "A made-up document of the event you choose, signed like any other, tried once." => "مستند مصطنع للحدث الذي تختاره، موقّع مثل أي مستند آخر، ويُرسل مرة واحدة.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Nothing more is sent to it, and anything still waiting is not sent. Its lines stay in the log until they age out." => "لن يُرسل إليه شيء بعد الآن، ولن يُرسل ما زال ينتظر. تبقى أسطره في السجل حتى تتقادم.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "The endpoint gets a signed JSON document each time one of the events you choose happens." => "تتلقى نقطة الاستقبال مستند JSON موقّعًا في كل مرة يقع فيها أحد الأحداث التي تختارها.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// shown through notice
  text "A sample was sent — its line is at the top of the log." => "أُرسل نموذج. سطره في أعلى السجل.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// shown through EmptyState.body
  text "Add one to send this app's events to another system — your own service, an automation tool, a data warehouse." => "أضف واحدًا لإرسال أحداث هذا التطبيق إلى نظام آخر: خدمتك الخاصة، أو أداة أتمتة، أو مستودع بيانات.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// beside: "I have copied it"
  text "Copy it into the receiving system now — it is not shown again. The receiver checks every document's webhook-signature header with it." => "انسخه إلى النظام المستقبِل الآن، فلن يُعرض مرة أخرى. يتحقق المستقبِل به من ترويسة webhook-signature في كل مستند.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// shown through FieldLabel.text
  text "Events it takes" => "الأحداث التي يستقبلها";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// shown through EmptyState.body
  text "Every document was taken by its endpoint." => "استقبلت نقطة الاستقبال كل مستند أُرسل إليها.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// beside: "Show every endpoint"
  text "One endpoint" => "نقطة استقبال واحدة";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// shown through Hint.text
  text "This app sends no events yet." => "لا يرسل هذا التطبيق أي أحداث بعد.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// shown through EmptyState.body
  text "When an event happens, each document sent for it is listed here." => "عند وقوع حدث، يظهر هنا كل مستند أُرسل بسببه.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {Trim} = name.Trim(…)
  /// shown through notice
  text "“{Trim}” added." => "أُضيف “{Trim}”.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {line.Name} = line.Name
  /// shown through notice
  text "“{line.Name}” paused — nothing is sent to it until it is resumed." => "أُوقف “{line.Name}” مؤقتًا. لن يُرسل إليه شيء حتى يُستأنف.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {line.Name} = line.Name
  /// shown through notice
  text "“{line.Name}” resumed — events from now on are sent to it." => "استُؤنف “{line.Name}”. تُرسل إليه الأحداث من الآن فصاعدًا.";
  /// WebhookSubscriptions · text on the page
